{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“如果丈夫休掉妻子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妻子离去另嫁别人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"前夫怎会再娶她呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那样做岂不完全玷污了土地吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾与许多情人苟合，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在要归向我吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“你举目看看那些光秃的高山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在哪里没有被玷污过呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你坐在路旁等候情郎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像旷野的游牧民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的淫乱恶行玷污了土地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，秋雨不降，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"春雨不来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却仍然不知羞耻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一副娼妓的嘴脸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不是刚对我说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我父啊！你从我年幼时就做我的挚友。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你会永远发怒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怀恨到底吗？’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你虽然这样说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却仍大肆作恶。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼吁背信的以色列悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在约西亚王执政期间，耶和华对我说：“你看见背信的以色列所行的了吗？她上到高山上、在绿树下淫乱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我以为她淫乱之后会回到我身边，她却执迷不悟。她不贞的妹妹犹大也看见了这事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["因为背信的以色列淫乱，我给她休书，把她休掉。她不贞的妹妹犹大却不害怕，竟也去淫乱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["以色列对淫乱不以为然，竟与石头木头苟合，玷污了土地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["尽管如此，她不贞的妹妹犹大只是假装归向我，并不诚心。这是耶和华说的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华对我说：“背信的以色列比不贞的犹大罪过还轻。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你去向北方宣告，",{"text":"“‘耶和华说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背信的以色列啊，回转吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不向你们发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我充满慈爱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不会永远怀怒。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘你必须要承认自己的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"承认背叛了你的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在绿树下祭拜各种外邦的神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不听从我的话。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“‘背信的子民啊，回转吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我是你们的主人","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要从你们中间选些人带回锡安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每座城邑选一人，每个宗族选二人。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["“‘我要赐给你们合我心意的牧人，让他们用知识与智慧牧养你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["你们在地上繁衍昌盛的时候，人们不会再提及耶和华的约柜，不会再把它放在心上，不会再想起它，不会再感到需要它，也不会再造一个。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["那时，耶路撒冷必被称为“耶和华的宝座”，万国都要聚集在耶路撒冷尊崇耶和华的名，不再执迷不悟地作恶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["那时，犹大人必与以色列人一同从北方来到我赐给你们祖先作基业的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“‘我曾想，我多么愿意把你们当成我的儿女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐给你们万国中最肥美的土地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我原以为你们会叫我“父亲”，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再不离我而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，以色列家啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们竟对我不忠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像不贞的妻子离开丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"从光秃的山头传来声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列子民哭泣呼求的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们走入歧途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘掉了他们的上帝耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“背信的子民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"归来吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要医治你们背信的病。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：“是的，我们要到你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你是我们的上帝耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在高山丘陵上狂欢、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拜偶像真是枉然，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我们的上帝耶和华才能拯救以色列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["“从我们年幼时，那些可耻的神像就吞噬了我们祖先辛苦得来的牛羊和儿女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["让我们躺在自己的羞耻中，让我们的耻辱遮盖我们吧！因为我们和我们的祖先都得罪了我们的上帝耶和华，我们自幼至今一直没有顺服我们的上帝耶和华。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“主人”或译作“丈夫”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}